# Cloudflare Pages response headers for docs.acruxcore.com (this file is copied
# into the build root and read by Pages at deploy time, never served).
#
# The Link header (RFC 8288) points an agent at the machine-readable resources
# without parsing HTML. The API catalog lives on the API's own host,
# acruxcore.com. Scoped to the home page only: a Link header set here replaces
# the preload hints Pages generates from each page's HTML, and the home page is
# where discovery tools look.
/
  Link: <https://acruxcore.com/.well-known/api-catalog>; rel="api-catalog", </api-reference>; rel="service-doc", </llms.txt>; rel="describedby"; type="text/markdown"
